From: bornaradusin <bornaradusin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 08:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 43/47] PC5: a game's settings tool isn't handed off (Wine
 patch 0931)

A game that starts its own settings tool and waits for it was handed
off as if it were a launcher starting the game: Far Cry starts
Bin32\FarCryConfigurator.exe /Caller=FarCry each time it opens, so it
ended, and the configurator closed at once. A program named as a
settings tool ("config", "setting") is a helper now, as a crash reporter
or an installer is: its start fails and the game carries on.
